<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Shinsegae Department H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Shinsegae Department H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				   358  vs 305</p>
<p>    Net					  4.01  vs 3.31</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			5.22  vs 4.94</p>
<p>    Revenue				  673.26  vs 565.79</p>
<p>NOTE - South Korea's first department store, Shinsegae Department Store Co Ltd, also runs discount stores and membership stores. The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
